# Application-layer framework-seam gate allowlist.
#
# The gate (tests/Unit/Shared/Architecture/EventDispatchGateTest.php) fails the build when a file
# under */Application/ imports a framework type instead of the port that replaces it:
#
#   Symfony\Component\Messenger\MessageBusInterface
#       -> Erpify\Shared\Event\Domain\EventBus            (docs/adr/event-driven-architecture.md)
#   Doctrine\ORM\EntityManagerInterface
#       -> Erpify\Shared\Persistence\Application\TransactionManager
#                                                          (docs/adr/external-dependencies-in-domain.md)
#
# An entry exempts a FILE, not a single FQCN: allowlisting a file stops the gate reading it for every
# forbidden type at once. Prefer moving the collaborator behind its port to widening this file.
#
# Lines starting with `#` and blank lines are ignored. Each remaining line is an api-relative path
# (POSIX, no leading slash) of an Application file exempted from the rule. Adding an entry is a
# deliberate, reviewable exception.
